          "lineage": "Bositra",
          "subspeciesCount": 0,
          "description": "Small-sized, feebly inflated, generally longer than high, obliquely ovate but occasionally suborbicular composite moulds. Dorsal margin short, straight, remaining margins well-rounded. Umbo inconspicuous, not protruding beyond dorsal margin and situated slightly anterior of mid-line of shell. Surface covered with 16 - 18 broad, rounded commarginal ribs, separated by narrow interstices.",
